# The front of a loop over what nobody has typed has a copy for each kind of floats (a-loop-over-what-nobody-knows-has-a-copy-for-each-kind-of-floats.ir).
# Where every element that the loop reads or stores off the holder goes through an operator on bits, a fraction would be thrown away at once: the loop's own text says that floats are not what it is written for.
# There they share the copy of the other views, as before: they are read rightly, by the kind of the cell.
# f1 = go
# RUN: walk f1:Body mechanisms=all
# CHECK: = TypeTest {{*}} testedType=Float32Array|Float64Array|Int16Array|Int32Array|Int8Array|Uint16Array|Uint32Array|Uint8ClampedArray
# CHECK-NOT: builtinClass=Float64Array
# CHECK-NOT: builtinClass=Float32Array
